## Boundary Notes

- KHS owns template/policy/proposal content.
- KAH owns validation, diff/propose/apply mechanics, checksum/version, and audit events.
- KAB evidence is backend/session evidence only, not graph policy authority.
- `kah graph` alias support is not assumed; use only evidenced `kkachi-agent-helper graph` command output.
- Missing graph capability means record the gap and use run-local `phase-plan.yaml` evidence only; do not directly edit `.kkachi-workflow.yaml` as fallback.
